{"version":1,"content":"<p>串流平台Netflix為慶祝進軍韓國十周年，於今、明兩日在首爾舉辦十周年大型派對，邀請不少參演人氣作品的韓星現身撐場。</p><p>今日活動從該平台過去10年推出的眾多作品中，挑選重要作品與粉絲交流，合作韓劇《D.P：逃兵追緝令》的丁海寅與具教煥合體現身</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-24T09:02:46.802583+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":121,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-24T08:39:12+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-24T08:58:19.999532+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-24T08:58:19.999532+00:00","content_hash":"dfd586049c89f2ada18e50ebf980b15907c991d9f8244339379b9c0c47e489d1","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}